<header class="intro-header">
    Who Am I?
</header>

<main>

<section>
    <p>
        Hello, my name is Guilherme Rodrigues Carvalho. I was born
        in the city of Toledo, in the state of Paraná, on February
        14, 2011. I am currently a student at IFPR in Toledo, which
        is actually an extension of the IF campus in
        Assis Chateaubriand.
    </p>

    <p>
        I have always been a good student. Although I have studied
        in public schools my entire life, I have always done well
        academically. I have never received a grade below the
        passing average throughout my school years.

        My education began at Escola Ecológica Ari Arcacio Gosler,
        in Toledo. I studied there from preschool until the fifth
        grade of elementary school. Even though I spent many years
        at that school, I never had any major problems.

        After finishing fifth grade, I had to change schools
        because that school only offered classes up to that grade.
        I transferred to Colégio Estadual João Cândido, where I
        studied from sixth to eighth grade.

        The education was average. In general, the teachers were
        not bad, but the students often disrupted lessons because
        they could not remain quiet. Despite that, I continued
        studying there.

        After finishing eighth grade, another school was completed
        across the street from where I lived. To make transportation
        easier, I changed schools. It was an interesting school,
        and the education was better than at my previous school.
        However, I stayed there for only one year because I managed
        to get a place at IFPR.
    </p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>My Birth</h2>
    <p>
        I remember the month of February well, when Guilherme
        Rodrigues Carvalho was born. He came into the world in
        Toledo, Paraná, in the Jardim Europa neighborhood,
        bringing great joy to our family.

        Everyone was excited about his arrival, and finally
        the moment came to meet him. It was a special day
        for everyone, one of those moments that remain
        in our memories.

        From then on, Guilherme began his own story, surrounded
        by family and new experiences. His birth was the beginning
        of a journey that, over the years, brought many moments,
        lessons, and memories.

        That is how I remember that February: as the month
        when Guilherme arrived and became part of our family.
    </p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Current Situation and Future Perspectives</h2>
    <p>
        Currently, I am working towards building my professional
        future in the field of programming. I am interested
        in technology and believe that working with programming
        can provide me with opportunities for growth, learning,
        and professional achievement.

        At this moment, I am preparing myself by developing
        my knowledge and acquiring the skills necessary
        to enter the job market.

        In the future, my goal is to work professionally
        in programming and build a stable and successful career.
        I want to keep learning, follow new technologies,
        and constantly improve my skills.

        I hope that, through effort and determination,
        I can turn my interest in programming into a profession
        and build a career that I can be proud of.
    </p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Where I Live</h2>
    <p>
        Jardim Gisela is a neighborhood in Toledo, in western
        Paraná, which developed alongside the growth of the city.
        Over the years, new families arrived in the area,
        contributing to the formation of the community
        and the development of streets, homes, businesses,
        and services.

        An interesting fact is that the growth of Jardim Gisela
        reflects an important characteristic of Toledo:
        the city developed from a small settlement formed
        during the colonization period into a municipality
        with several neighborhoods and a much larger population.

        Therefore, places that today seem to have always been
        part of the city are actually the result of urban expansion
        over several decades.

        Jardim Gisela is currently mainly a residential area
        and is part of Toledo's history of growth. Its residents,
        streets, and public spaces are part of the transformation
        of the municipality and help build the community's identity.
    </p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>My Neighborhood</h2>
    <p>
        An important event that took place in the neighborhood
        was the inauguration of the new Colégio Estadual
        Jardim Gisella.

        The school received a new structure, with classrooms,
        a library, laboratories, activity rooms, and a sports court.

        The inauguration took place in February 2025 and was
        attended by students, teachers, residents, and authorities.

        This initiative can be related to the Contemporary
        Cross-Cutting Themes because it involves education,
        citizenship, and improving the quality of life
        of people living in the area.

        With the new school, students gained a better place
        to study and carry out their activities.
    </p>
</section>

